  << /ActualText (Senior Product Designer and Industrial Design Engineer with 5\053 years of experience designing digital products across enterprise applications\054 retail\054 financial services\054 and e\055commerce\056 Specialized in B2B SaaS and Enterprise UX\054 B2B onboarding\054 analytics dashboard design\054 complex workflow optimization\054 navigation redesign\054 and scalable design systems\056\n\nAdvanced Figma proficiency\054 including component architecture\054 variants\054 Auto Layout\054 shared libraries\054 and high\055fidelity interactive prototyping\056 Experienced in translating complex business requirements and datasets into intuitive digital experiences that support commercial operations\054 merchandising\054 sales performance\054 and marketing analytics\056\n\nStrong background in brand visual language\054 brand consistency\054 UX research\054 information architecture\054 and user\055centered design\056 Experienced collaborating with Product Managers\054 engineers\054 data analysts\054 and business stakeholders to deliver scalable\054 technically feasible\054 and visually cohesive digital products\056)
